    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/e85e8cc7a4d3f72b3a3fa4593e311942.webp?t=1720452140\" width=577 height=59 /></span><br>Explore the world as Jim, an ex-gangster, struggling with mental illness. Uncover the mystery of the shadowy figure bent on killing you and discover the secrets lurking beneath the surface\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/8877a44b07aed5966aef183eb9450127.webp?t=1720452140\" width=577 height=59 /></span><br><strong>The Game's Story</strong> reveals eerie character connections and dark secrets. As dream and reality blur, brace for horrors beyond nightmares, transcending fear into unknown terror.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/b70ebb69deb5e04f1b57c83ba5374a69.poster.avif?t=1720452140\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/b70ebb69deb5e04f1b57c83ba5374a69.webm?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/b70ebb69deb5e04f1b57c83ba5374a69.mp4?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Voice Casting</strong> for all character dialogues in our game, setting us apart with a unique feature. Few games offer this nowadays, enhancing your playing experience significantly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/e75a9600829d72db05d6645dc33b56e8.poster.avif?t=1720452140\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/e75a9600829d72db05d6645dc33b56e8.webm?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/e75a9600829d72db05d6645dc33b56e8.mp4?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Diverse locales</strong> as the story unfolds, ensuring a dynamic and engaging experience that evolves with the gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/d18296768dc9026522a91bb532b6dcbc.poster.avif?t=1720452140\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/d18296768dc9026522a91bb532b6dcbc.webm?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/d18296768dc9026522a91bb532b6dcbc.mp4?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Array of challenging puzzles</strong>, not easily conquered by all. Only puzzle masters will breeze through them effortlessly. These puzzles demand keen attention to all in-game clues, along with sharp wit and creativity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/1b90240e94a1ed0931d31d09178fdddc.poster.avif?t=1720452140\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/1b90240e94a1ed0931d31d09178fdddc.webm?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/1b90240e94a1ed0931d31d09178fdddc.mp4?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Captivating Gameplay in our game</strong>, from survival puzzles to thrilling chase sequences. Engage in detective work, gathering evidence and solving mysteries with keen observation. With RPG elements, shape your character and story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/9229546702f91a1fcc429a2bb39e5a9e.poster.avif?t=1720452140\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/9229546702f91a1fcc429a2bb39e5a9e.webm?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/9229546702f91a1fcc429a2bb39e5a9e.mp4?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gritty gangster-themed world, our game's story delves into the darker side of society. Navigate through a realm tinged with drugs, alcohol, and violence. It's a narrative that captures the essence of the underworld without overwhelming the player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/f65dadd15c4080faa7ed57ef03e50d35.poster.avif?t=1720452140\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/f65dadd15c4080faa7ed57ef03e50d35.webm?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/f65dadd15c4080faa7ed57ef03e50d35.mp4?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/e85e8cc7a4d3f72b3a3fa4593e311942.webp?t=1720452140\" width=577 height=59 /></span><br>Explore the world as Jim, an ex-gangster, struggling with mental illness. Uncover the mystery of the shadowy figure bent on killing you and discover the secrets lurking beneath the surface\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/8877a44b07aed5966aef183eb9450127.webp?t=1720452140\" width=577 height=59 /></span><br><strong>The Game's Story</strong> reveals eerie character connections and dark secrets. As dream and reality blur, brace for horrors beyond nightmares, transcending fear into unknown terror.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/b70ebb69deb5e04f1b57c83ba5374a69.poster.avif?t=1720452140\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/b70ebb69deb5e04f1b57c83ba5374a69.webm?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/b70ebb69deb5e04f1b57c83ba5374a69.mp4?t=1720452140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Voice Casting</strong> for all character dialogues in our game, setting us apart with a unique feature. Few games offer this nowadays, enhancing your playing experience significantly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760650/extras/e75a9600829d72db05d6645dc33b56e8.poster.avif?t=1720452140\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s